\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx780\", \"category\": \"flexible\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-flx780.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1200, \"highPrice\": 8000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx780\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"7.8mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"6,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"128 x 64 per strip\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the FlexiMesh 7.8mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 7.8mm, which defines the distance between LED pixels. This pitch offers a clear and vibrant image quality suitable for medium to large viewing distances, making it ideal for architectural media and stage backdrops.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the FlexiMesh 7.8mm, and can it handle outdoor sunlight?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 6,000 nits, the FlexiMesh 7.8mm is highly visible even in direct sunlight. This ensures excellent image clarity and impact in outdoor environments such as building wraps and event stages.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation methods are recommended for this flexible LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The FlexiMesh 7.8mm can be installed using tension wire systems or framed installations. Its ultra-lightweight and flexible nature allow it to easily drape over structures, enabling architectural creativity and quick setup.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the FlexiMesh 7.8mm compare to traditional rigid LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike rigid displays, FlexiMesh is extremely lightweight at 4.5 kg/sqm and flexible, allowing it to conform to building facades and curved surfaces. It also offers 60% transparency, enabling natural light and airflow, which rigid screens cannot provide.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the FlexiMesh 7.8mm suitable for high wind areas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is designed as a wind-permeable mesh and has been tested to withstand wind loads up to 120 km/h. This makes it ideal for outdoor installations on high-rise buildings and exposed locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the lifespan and serviceability of this LED mesh display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The FlexiMesh 7.8mm has an operational lifespan of approximately 80,000 hours. It features rear access for service, allowing easy maintenance without dismantling the entire installation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty or support does Brightluxx offer for the FlexiMesh 7.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty and support services tailored to project needs, ensuring reliable operation and prompt maintenance. Specific warranty terms can be discussed with our sales team based on your application.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of applications are best suited for the FlexiMesh 7.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED mesh excels in applications requiring lightweight, flexible displays like building wraps, architectural media, and stage backdrops. Its transparency and durability also make it suitable for creative facades where airflow and natural light are essential.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"FlexiMesh 7.8mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx780\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>FlexiMesh 7.8mm</h1><p>Get the FlexiMesh 7.8mm flexible LED display perfect for dynamic installations in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for bespoke solutions!</p><p><strong>Ultra-light mesh for architectural media.</strong></p><p>Weighing just 4.5 kg/sqm, drapes over building facades and stage backdrops like fabric. Wind-permeable mesh design with IP65 protection. Tested to 120km/h wind loads.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the FlexiMesh 7.8mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 7.8mm, which defines the distance between LED pixels. This pitch offers a clear and vibrant image quality suitable for medium to large viewing distances, making it ideal for architectural media and stage backdrops.</p><h3>How bright is the FlexiMesh 7.8mm, and can it handle outdoor sunlight?</h3><p>With a brightness of 6,000 nits, the FlexiMesh 7.8mm is highly visible even in direct sunlight. This ensures excellent image clarity and impact in outdoor environments such as building wraps and event stages.</p><h3>What installation methods are recommended for this flexible LED display?</h3><p>The FlexiMesh 7.8mm can be installed using tension wire systems or framed installations. Its ultra-lightweight and flexible nature allow it to easily drape over structures, enabling architectural creativity and quick setup.</p><h3>How does the FlexiMesh 7.8mm compare to traditional rigid LED displays?</h3><p>Unlike rigid displays, FlexiMesh is extremely lightweight at 4.5 kg/sqm and flexible, allowing it to conform to building facades and curved surfaces. It also offers 60% transparency, enabling natural light and airflow, which rigid screens cannot provide.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"bl-flx780\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/bl-flx780\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefin