9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n15:T691,\\u003ch1\\u003eFlexiMesh 7.8mm\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eGet the FlexiMesh 7.8mm flexible LED display perfect for dynamic installations in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for bespoke solutions!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eUltra-light mesh for architectural media.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWeighing just 4.5 kg/sqm, drapes over building facades and stage backdrops like fabric. Wind-permeable mesh design with IP65 protection. Tested to 120km/h wind loads.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the FlexiMesh 7.8mm and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 7.8mm, which defines the distance between LED pixels. This pitch offers a clear and vibrant image quality suitable for medium to large viewing distances, making it ideal for architectural media and stage backdrops.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the FlexiMesh 7.8mm, and can it handle outdoor sunlight?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith a brightness of 6,000 nits, the FlexiMesh 7.8mm is highly visible even in direct sunlight. This ensures excellent image clarity and impact in outdoor environments such as building wraps and event stages.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat installation methods are recommended for this flexible LED display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe FlexiMesh 7.8mm can be installed using tension wire systems or framed installations. Its ultra-lightweight and flexible nature allow it to easily drape over structures, enabling architectural creativity and quick setup.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the FlexiMesh 7.8mm compare to traditional rigid LED displays?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eUnlike rigid displays, FlexiMesh is extremely lightweight at 4.5 kg/sqm and flexible, allowing it to conform to building facades and curved surfaces. It also offers 60% transparency, enabling natural light and airflow, which rigid screens cannot provide.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"FlexiMesh 7.8mm Flexible LED Display - Durable Dubai Tech | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Get the FlexiMesh 7.8mm flexible LED display perfect for dynamic installations in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for bespoke solutions!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx780\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1j