/schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T691,<h1>FlexiMesh 7.8mm</h1><p>Get the FlexiMesh 7.8mm flexible LED display perfect for dynamic installations in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for bespoke solutions!</p><p><strong>Ultra-light mesh for architectural media.</strong></p><p>Weighing just 4.5 kg/sqm, drapes over building facades and stage backdrops like fabric. Wind-permeable mesh design with IP65 protection. Tested to 120km/h wind loads.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the FlexiMesh 7.8mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 7.8mm, which defines the distance between LED pixels. This pitch offers a clear and vibrant image quality suitable for medium to large viewing distances, making it ideal for architectural media and stage backdrops.</p><h3>How bright is the FlexiMesh 7.8mm, and can it handle outdoor sunlight?</h3><p>With a brightness of 6,000 nits, the FlexiMesh 7.8mm is highly visible even in direct sunlight. This ensures excellent image clarity and impact in outdoor environments such as building wraps and event stages.</p><h3>What installation methods are recommended for this flexible LED display?</h3><p>The FlexiMesh 7.8mm can be installed using tension wire systems or framed installations. Its ultra-lightweight and flexible nature allow it to easily drape over structures, enabling architectural creativity and quick setup.</p><h3>How does the FlexiMesh 7.8mm compare to traditional rigid LED displays?</h3><p>Unlike rigid displays, FlexiMesh is extremely lightweight at 4.5 kg/sqm and flexible, allowing it to conform to building facades and curved surfaces. It also offers 60% transparency, enabling natural light and airflow, which rigid screens cannot provide.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"FlexiMesh 7.8mm Flexible LED Display - Durable Dubai Tech | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get the FlexiMesh 7.8mm flexible LED display perfect for dynamic installations in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE for bespoke solutions!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-flx780\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T566,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"FlexiMesh 7.8mm\", \"description\": \"Weighing just 4.5 kg/sqm, drapes over building facades and stage backdrops like fabric. Wind-permeable mesh design with IP65 protection. Tested to 120km/h wind loads.\", \"sku\": \"BL-FLX780\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https: