llation methods are recommended for this flexible LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The FlexiMesh 7.8mm can be installed using tension wire systems or framed installations. Its ultra-lightweight and flexible nature allow it to easily drape over structures, enabling architectural creativity and quick setup.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the FlexiMesh 7.8mm compare to traditional rigid LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike rigid displays, FlexiMesh is extremely lightweight at 4.5 kg/sqm and flexible, allowing it to conform to building facades and curved surfaces. It also offers 60% transparency, enabling natural light and airflow, which rigid screens cannot provide.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the FlexiMesh 7.8mm suitable for high wind areas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is designed as a wind-permeable mesh and has been tested to withstand wind loads up to 120 km/h. This makes it ideal for outdoor installations on high-rise buildings and exposed locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the lifespan and serviceability of this LED mesh display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The FlexiMesh 7.8mm has an operational lifespan of approximately 80,000 hours. It features rear access for service, allowing easy maintenance without dismantling the entire installation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of warranty or support does Brightluxx offer for the FlexiMesh 7.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty and support services tailored to project needs, ensuring reliable operation and prompt maintenance. Specific warranty terms can be discussed with our sales team based on your application.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of applications are best suited for the FlexiMesh 7.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED mesh excels in applications requiring lightweight, flexible displays like building wraps, architectural media, and stage backdrops. Its transparency and durability also make it suitable for creative facades where airflow and natural light are essential.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$3\"}}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L10\",\"isPartial\":\"$@11\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@12\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@13\"}\n15:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n16:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n18:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n19:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n1a:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n1b:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n1c:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n4:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\",